{
  "$comment": [
    "Tier-2 differential for wardrobe FOLDER FILING (P4.D309 — v4 bbbcd2388,",
    "lib/wardrobe/folder-filing.ts fileItemsToFolder), ported to",
    "quilltap-core::services::wardrobe_folder_filing::file_items_to_folder.",
    "One committed file drives BOTH sides:",
    "  - build-folder-filing-fixture.ts bakes the seed (a character + vault, an",
    "    ARCHIVED character, Quilltap General, a project store, a group store; the",
    "    items below through v4's REAL vault writers; pictures through v4's REAL",
    "    addWardrobeItemImage; wear rows raw) into /tmp/qt-ffl-main.db + mount.db;",
    "  - folder-filing-tier2.ts (the oracle) and folder_filing_tier2_equivalence.rs",
    "    (the port) each run every CHAIN against a FRESH copy of the fixture",
    "    through the REAL / ported fileItemsToFolder over resolveWardrobeLocation.",
    "An itemIds entry is an `items` key, or `raw:<id>` for an id the seed lacks.",
    "Seed titles are unique (no slug falls back to a UUID path); `Shirt (copy)`",
    "pre-exists in Evening (a copy of Shirt is `Shirt (copy 2)` across folders);",
    "`Bowler Hat (copy 3)` shares Bowler Hat's base (one request mints `(copy)`",
    "and `(copy 2)`)."
  ],
